WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.420
What was your first job before your career?

00:00:02.421 --> 00:00:05.340
My first job is I worked at American Apparel at the Garner State Plaza,

00:00:05.341 --> 00:00:06.810
in New Jersey, Hello

00:00:06.811 --> 00:00:08.020
You were a tumblr girl

00:00:08.021 --> 00:00:10.420
I was, and I was also an American Apparel model at the same time,

00:00:10.421 --> 00:00:11.582
so it was really fun
